    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="71.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 71.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Kyncges ðeines. And syððan kyncges ðægnes heregeata ðe him nyxste syndon—IIII hors, II gesadelode ⁊ twa ungesadelode, ⁊ II swyrd ⁊ IIII spera ⁊ ealswa feola scylda ⁊ helm ⁊ byrnan ⁊ fiftig mancus goldes.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">The heriot of a king's thegn. And further, the heriots of king's thegns who stand in immediate relation to him shall be four horses, two saddled and two unsaddled, and two swords and four spears and as many shields and helmets and byrnies and 50 mancuses of gold.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ syððan cingces þegnas, þe him nyhste syndan: IIII hors, II gesadelode ⁊ II unsadelode, ⁊ II swurd ⁊ IIII spera ⁊ swa feala scylda ⁊ helm ⁊ byrnan ⁊ L mances goldes.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
